{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "critical points of abs(x) + abs(x - 1):\n  abs(x) + abs(x - 1)' = sign(x) + sign(x - 1)\n  x ≈ 0.5: local minimum, abs(x) + abs(x - 1) = 1\n    (abs(x) + abs(x - 1)' is 0 to real rounding within 0.495 of it: one point)\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "crit", "ucas": "crit abs(x)+abs(x-1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crit", "derivative": "sign(x) + sign(x - 1)", "points": [{"x": 0.5, "kind": "local minimum", "value": 1}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "sign changes of the derivative on a grid, refined by bisection"}, "files": [], "text": "critical points of abs(x) + abs(x - 1):\n  abs(x) + abs(x - 1)' = sign(x) + sign(x - 1)\n  x ≈ 0.5: local minimum, abs(x) + abs(x - 1) = 1\n    (abs(x) + abs(x - 1)' is 0 to real rounding within 0.495 of it: one point)\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "critical points of max(min(x, 1), -1):\n  max(min(x, 1), -1)' = min(x, 1) >= -1 ? x <= 1 ? 1 : 0 : 0\n  x ≈ -5.5025: stationary inflection, max(min(x, 1), -1) = -1\n    (max(min(x, 1), -1)' is 0 to real rounding within 4.5 of it: one point)\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "crit", "ucas": "crit max(min(x,1),-1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crit", "derivative": "min(x, 1) >= -1 ? x <= 1 ? 1 : 0 : 0", "points": [{"x": -5.5025, "kind": "stationary inflection", "value": -1}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "sign changes of the derivative on a grid, refined by bisection"}, "files": [], "text": "critical points of max(min(x, 1), -1):\n  max(min(x, 1), -1)' = min(x, 1) >= -1 ? x <= 1 ? 1 : 0 : 0\n  x ≈ -5.5025: stationary inflection, max(min(x, 1), -1) = -1\n    (max(min(x, 1), -1)' is 0 to real rounding within 4.5 of it: one point)\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "monotonic max(x, 0):\n  non-decreasing (increasing, not strictly) on [-10, 10]\n  checked numerically on [-10, 10] (x has no range; give it one); turning points refined on f'\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "monotonic", "ucas": "monotonic max(x,0)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "monotonic", "var": "x", "verdict": "non-decreasing (increasing, not strictly)", "on": "[-10, 10]", "intervals": [{"lo": -10, "hi": 10, "direction": "increasing", "strict": false}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "checked numerically on [-10, 10] (x has no range; give it one); turning points refined on f'"}, "files": [], "text": "monotonic max(x, 0):\n  non-decreasing (increasing, not strictly) on [-10, 10]\n  checked numerically on [-10, 10] (x has no range; give it one); turning points refined on f'\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "monotonic abs(x) + abs(x - 1):\n  not monotonic on [-10, 10]\n  maximal intervals of monotonicity:\n    x in [-10, 0.9995]: decreasing (not strictly)\n    x in [0.9995, 10]: increasing\n  witness: x = 0.9995 < x = 10 but f(0.9995) = 1 < f(10) = 19 (not decreasing)\n  witness: x = -10 < x = 0.9995 but f(-10) = 21 > f(0.9995) = 1 (not increasing)\n  checked numerically on [-10, 10] (x has no range; give it one); turning points refined on f'\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "monotonic", "ucas": "monotonic abs(x)+abs(x-1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "monotonic", "var": "x", "verdict": "not monotonic", "on": "[-10, 10]", "intervals": [{"lo": -10, "hi": 0.9995, "direction": "decreasing", "strict": false}, {"lo": 0.9995, "hi": 10, "direction": "increasing", "strict": true}], "witness_not_decreasing": [0.9995, 10], "witness_not_increasing": [-10, 0.9995]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "checked numerically on [-10, 10] (x has no range; give it one); turning points refined on f'"}, "files": [], "text": "monotonic abs(x) + abs(x - 1):\n  not monotonic on [-10, 10]\n  maximal intervals of monotonicity:\n    x in [-10, 0.9995]: decreasing (not strictly)\n    x in [0.9995, 10]: increasing\n  witness: x = 0.9995 < x = 10 but f(0.9995) = 1 < f(10) = 19 (not decreasing)\n  witness: x = -10 < x = 0.9995 but f(-10) = 21 > f(0.9995) = 1 (not increasing)\n  checked numerically on [-10, 10] (x has no range; give it one); turning points refined on f'\n"}, "isError": false}}
